# Architecture Rules (Next.js 15)

- Server Components по умолчанию
- Мутации только через Server Actions
- Multi-tenant: каждый филиал = tenant_id + RLS в Supabase
- Структура:
  app/(dashboard)/
  app/(auth)/
  lib/prisma/
  lib/smartshell/
  components/dashboard/
- PWA: manifest + service worker